{"id":"n25163-1-9","stage":3,"title":"일손 · 手","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25163-1-9-1","ko":"잠시 일손을 멈추고 여기 와 보십시오.","zh":"请暂时停下手头的工作，到这儿来一下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잠시","meaning":"暂时，一会儿","explanation":"잠시：暂时，一会儿","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26895","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}},{"text":"일손을","meaning":"手，活儿","explanation":"일손：手，活儿；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일손","audio":"/audio/0358883302ff95a41f80.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25163","senseId":"1","lemma":"일손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일손을","audio":"/audio/494e111ba9a1f07fe96a.mp3"}},{"text":"멈추고","meaning":"停止，止住","explanation":"멈추다：停止，止住；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"멈추다","audio":"/audio/eaee887b30c38d735354.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46133","senseId":"4","lemma":"멈추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멈추고","audio":"/audio/7bf25f3fa79d6669f3d4.mp3"}},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"와","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}},{"text":"보십시오.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㅂ시오：正式敬语的请求或命令语尾；通常与시合成십시오。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"5","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보십시오","audio":"/audio/9d2818691597447038d1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6fcdfa8c124ab5cb","term":"잠시","zh":"暂时，一会儿","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3","entryId":"26895","definition":"在很短的时间之内。","pronunciation":["잠ː시"]},{"id":"0358883302ff95a4","term":"일손","zh":"手，活儿","audio":"/audio/0358883302ff95a41f80.mp3","entryId":"25163","definition":"正在干活的手，或指用手做的事。","pronunciation":["일ː쏜"]},{"id":"eaee887b30c38d73","term":"멈추다","zh":"停止，止住","audio":"/audio/eaee887b30c38d735354.mp3","entryId":"46133","definition":"终止正在做的事情或动作。","pronunciation":["멈추다"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b7816ef7f57b2065715d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25163-1-9-2","ko":"무슨 일인데 바쁜 우리를 부르는 거요?","zh":"怎么了，要叫我们这些正忙的人过去？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"일인데","meaning":"事，工作","explanation":"일：事，工作；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"5","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일인데","audio":"/audio/3e8dafd1b93554a52226.mp3"}},{"text":"바쁜","meaning":"忙，忙碌，紧张","explanation":"바쁘다：忙，忙碌，紧张；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"1","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바쁜","audio":"/audio/44dbdc21bbdbc683958f.mp3"}},{"text":"우리를","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리를","audio":"/audio/2e24f478a23b082fd00d.mp3"}},{"text":"부르는","meaning":"请，叫","explanation":"부르다：请，叫；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"9","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부르는","audio":"/audio/2d37c4d9f3d6714f3381.mp3"}},{"text":"거요?","meaning":"某种事物、行为或情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거 是 것 的口语形式，把前面的修饰内容概括为事物、行为或情况。这里不表示指示代词“那个”；具体的时态、疑问或推测语气结合前后的语尾理解。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거요","audio":"/audio/9d0b7f412cd31479ee89.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"需要解决或处理的问题或事项。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"忙，忙碌，紧张","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"因为要做的事情多或没有时间而无暇顾及其他。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"169eb5d7a0d76e97","term":"부르다","zh":"请，叫","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3","entryId":"57304","definition":"请求对方过来。","pronunciation":["부르다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、行为或情况","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、行为或情况","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/58aea569a77739805fcb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.788,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25163","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":98,"sequenceScore":2.6147,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["请暂时停下手头的工作，到这儿来一下。","怎么了，要叫我们这些正忙的人过去？","您要刷卡支付吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["请暂时停下手头的工作，到这儿来一下。","怎么了，要叫我们这些正忙的人过去？","您要刷卡支付吗？"],"answer":1}]}
